          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.120:block:4",
          "start": 905
        },
        "quote": "(e) No bare ground shall be left exposed. Grass or other groundcover or mulch, such as pine straw or tree bark, shall cover all bare ground.",
